# Line endings (2026-10-20, Windows and Linux): files keep LF in the repository and in every checkout,
# so a Windows clone reads the same bytes as macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Model and weather files are read byte for byte: the sample IFC's SHA-256 is its identity (samples/README.md),
# so git never rewrites their line ends.
*.ifc -text
*.epw -text
*.ddy -text
*.idf -text
*.stat -text

# Binary
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
